# CoolerControl lives in the GURU overlay, which is user-maintained, and is
# keyworded ~amd64 (testing) there. Accepted for this package alone rather than
# globally, so one overlay package does not drag the whole system onto testing.
#
# Wanted for the Aquacomputer Quadro: the kernel's aquacomputer_d5next driver
# already exposes its 3 PWM channels and the nct6799 exposes the board's, so
# this adds curve editing and graphs over hardware that already works - not new
# capability. fancontrol from lm-sensors is the in-tree alternative.
sys-apps/coolercontrold ~amd64
